1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
MAN: Do we still have far to go? This carry-on bag is really hurting my shoulder.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:08,000
WOMAN: We're almost there. The gate is just up those stairs there

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,170
What do you have in your bag anyway?

4
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:13,620
MAN: Oh, I picked up some CDs and toys for my kids

5
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,129
The prices are unbelievably cheap here.

6
00:00:16,129 --> 00:00:18,460
WOMAN: This must be your first trip here

7
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:21,280
I remember picking up things when I first came here.

8
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:27,130
After a while, you forget that everything here is cheaper than things back home.
